---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="(. )° Studio — About">
  <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 48px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; margin: 0 0 24px;">
    ABOUT
  </h1>
  <div style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 640px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">
    <p style="margin: 0;">
      I grew up on a small island called Florianópolis&mdash;Lat. 27&ordm;S, Long. 48&ordm;W. I
      graduated in Architecture, specialized in Art Direction, and pursued my career between
      the worlds of Art, Illustration, Design, Architecture, Advertising, and Technology.
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">
      I landed on this other much more oversized island called NYC in March of 2008. I
      started at Catch24Design, a small shop owned by Bill Goodspeed, a huge Yankee fan.
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">
      I moved in-house for Scholastic, and a year after that, I had my first opportunity at
      the larger communication groups. Publicis, WPP, and IPG. Roughly thirteen years
      altogether, and the people I met along the way were some of the finest in the business.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
